[{"title":"送黄仲逊之安平镇巡检","author":"王绂","text":"闻说安平镇，荆湖当要关。\n潇湘合二水，衡霍拱千山。\n地僻居民少，时清逻卒閒。\n遥知到官后，多在醉吟间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13041,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暇曰读楞严经偶成","author":"王绂","text":"劳生何扰扰，衰鬓已萧萧。\n偶得《楞严》读，都将世虑消。\n水流虚谷静，云度碧天遥。\n独坐忘言久，西山对寂寥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13042,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花上白头翁","author":"王绂","text":"欲诉芳心未肯休，不知春色去难留。\n东君亦是无情物，莫向花间怨白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13043,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹赠潘晦初","author":"王绂","text":"灯下歌狂酒半醺，兴来为尔写秋云。\n故人湖海如相问，骨立萧然似此君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13044,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题静乐轩 其二","author":"王绂","text":"竹几藤床小砚屏，薰风帘幕篆烟青。\n閒斋几日黄梅雨，添得芭蕉绿满庭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13045,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题静乐轩 其三","author":"王绂","text":"秋声早已到梧桐，露气生凉湛碧空。\n独倚阑干待明月，紫箫吹彻木樨风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13046,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题静乐轩 其四","author":"王绂","text":"斗帐藏春日醉眠，静中唯与懒相便。\n寻常甲子无心记，看到梅花又一年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13047,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小乔观书","author":"王绂","text":"云髻新妆珠翠团，杏花零落晓风寒。\n每怜春事伤心处，偷把周郎曲谱看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13048,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写竹寄俞朝宗先生","author":"王绂","text":"与君一别十年馀，每见人来问起居。\n尽说丰神清似竹，霜明须发影疏疏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13049,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题雁 其三","author":"王绂","text":"联翩飞处影横斜，暝色和烟暗荻花。\n远水微茫千万顷，不妨随意宿平沙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13050,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其二","author":"王绂","text":"汀洲潮落雨初晴，独坐兰舟酒半醒。\n欲采芙蓉过江去，迢迢秋水数峰青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13051,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"折杨柳词","author":"王绂","text":"每为多情记别离，道傍披拂乱如丝。\n东风也学时人态，偏向柔条恣意吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13052,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为夏叔度写葡萄于雪洲之上因赋叙别","author":"王绂","text":"我生负气尤好奇，襟怀抑塞蟠蛟螭。\n屡遭屈折莫我知，向人委顺长低垂。\n倘尔逢君雪洲上，酌我凉州寄来酿。\n醉倾墨汁为君涂，一吐胸中气千丈。\n维时雨歇凉风生，薄阴零乱纵复横。\n蛰龙蜕骨冷云湿，骊珠出海秋蟾明。\n坐间观者皆惊讶，何繇宝帐人间挂。\n恐令痴眼起贪心，主者收藏始知画。\n知我如君能有几，此术聊将游戏耳。\n白鸥湖海一身轻，长揖谢君吾去矣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13053,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题真上人竹茶炉","author":"王绂","text":"僧馆高闲事事幽，竹编茶灶瀹清流。\n气蒸阳羡三春雨，声带湘江两岸秋。\n玉臼夜敲苍雪冷，翠瓯晴引碧云稠。\n禅翁托此重开社，若个知心是赵州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13054,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹","author":"王绂","text":"宫树栖鸦拜夕郎，洞门烟霭竹苍苍。\n佩声摇曳归来晚，香篆初消月到床。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13055,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过扬州","author":"史谨","text":"长空开霁晚霞明，篷底淮山隔岸青。\n鸦散黑云为阵势，枫飘红雨作秋声。\n蕃釐玉树应无种，东阁官梅尚有名。\n惆怅牧之招不得，与谁同醉竹西亭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13056,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃叶渡","author":"史谨","text":"重经古渡立斜曛，愁见桃花两岸春。\n欲向东风唱桃叶，江边怕有别离人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13057,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湘江夜泊","author":"史谨","text":"扁舟载月下三湘，露渚风来杜若香。\n一片秋声无处著，和愁散入水云乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13058,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日次周县宰韵","author":"史谨","text":"映水芙蓉簇绛霞，水边开宴坐临花。\n秋娘老去风流尽，系臂犹悬一缕纱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13059,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"史谨","text":"数株烟柳绿毵毵，两岸青山起暮岚。\n多少天涯未归客，却从画里看江南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13060,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过七星关","author":"史谨","text":"万里投南徼，层关度七星。\n岭云和瘴黑，木叶向冬青。\n路远家难问，愁多酒易醒。\n相逢但樵牧，何以慰飘零。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13061,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿洞庭庙","author":"史谨","text":"山势如龙入洞庭，仙人楼阁倚青冥。\n钟声缥缈连三界，云气苍茫护六丁。\n蝴蝶梦回山月晓，鲤鱼风起浪花腥。\n无因得受还丹术，自把长镵采茯苓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13062,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书铁炉驿","author":"史谨","text":"铜鼓营前日欲西，铁炉冈下鹧鸪啼。\n却怜迢递南来使，万壑千崖入宁溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13063,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"直房闻桂香","author":"史谨","text":"松阴池馆昼偏凉，何处飘来桂子香。\n起傍雕阑看秋色，广寒宫殿近昭阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13064,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蜀山道中","author":"史谨","text":"盘盘鸟道接峨眉，剑阁横空北斗低。\n羁思不堪过夜半，万山深处一猿啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13065,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"车遥遥","author":"袁宗","text":"车遥遥，天未明。\n铜龙鼓响霜满城，驱车出门何处行？\n货多车重牛不进，竹鞭鞭牛牛力尽。\n车遥遥，不可留。\n我身愿化车下轮，千里万里从君游。\n车遥遥，不可止。\n我身愿化山下石，摧君之车君乃已。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13066,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题美人春睡图","author":"袁宗","text":"东风小院阑干曲，满地梨花涴香玉。\n金囟昼静燕初闲，火养沉烟一丝绿。\n美人消瘦桃花肌，春腰玉减一尺围。\n碧纱帐小蝉翅薄，睡损舞裙金缕衣。\n绿云盘盘堆枕重，翠滑斜偏小金凤。\n啼杀流莺唤不醒，风流政作江南梦。\n槛前芍药吹幽香，隔花玉漏声正长。\n冶情荡漾收不得，误随蝶过东家墙。\n东家墙里新妆女，两两三三喧笑语。\n西亭昨夜烂张筵，烛腻铜盘照歌舞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13067,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"莫种树","author":"袁宗","text":"莫种树，种树枝叶稠。\n春雨枝枝泣，秋风叶叶愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13068,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜游曲","author":"袁宗","text":"青天云去如平湖，银河界空月明孤。\n百花飘香柳垂影，千金一刻谁能沽。\n危城移更起琼箭，华屋向月开铜铺。\n青丝绾结白玉壶，酒倾凿落金芙蕖。\n瑶筝冰弦挂银雁，沉水翠缕飞金凫。\n美人呼来歌鹧鸪，缠头匹锦三斛株。\n凤皇叫月清可听，杨柳颤风娇欲扶。\n戏挥樽前铁如意，击碎座上珊瑚珠。\n梨花风动香玉肤，片片飞舞沾罗襦。\n杜鹃啼血吻欲枯，青春屈指一半无。\n井桐哑哑啼老乌，女垣欻见横星枢。\n金篦插月夜莫徂，楼头画鼓停一枹。\n相逢萍水皆尘途，忧愤暂变为欢娱。\n此时不饮胡为乎，素发种种侵头颅。\n龙铅虎汞总一炉，顾我凡质非仙徒。\n牙筹在手身忽殂，白璧乌能润黄垆。\n劝尔痛饮毋踟蹰，醉后笑语从卢胡。\n更买五斗粉与朱，为我绘作宵游图。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13069,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓寒曲","author":"袁宗","text":"秋江夜雨芙蓉老，翡翠双飞下红蓼。\n鲤鱼风起鸿雁悲，彻骨清寒梦魂杳。\n碧纱如烟隔啼鸟，龟甲屏风香篆小。\n阿侯白马不归来，被冷鸳鸯洞房晓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13070,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"铁箫歌","author":"袁宗","text":"滇江夜半风雨黑，电火烧空轰霹雳。\n须臾雨霁波浪恬，江壖脱却苍龙脊。\n道人骑鲸江上来，见之错愕惊而咍。\n拾得归来世希罕，土花绣涩生莓苔。\n上有空星泛宫徵，嶰谷苍莨岂堪比。\n六丁鼓鞴神功成，百炼金精雪花起。\n一吹潜蛟舞，载吹嫠妇泣。\n孤鸾长吟音袅袅，碎玉玲珑真可拾。\n酒酣为我三复吹，青天行云不敢飞。\n初如七十二凤声雄雌，又若独茧抽出冰蚕丝。\n东望蓬莱山，把酒招安期。\n飘飘清兴不可遏，听君一曲歌我诗。\n曲终酒尽客且散，西轩月在梨花枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13071,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆钱塘","author":"袁宗","text":"十载飘零客路赊，钱塘无复睹繁华。\n六桥杨柳林逋墓，一树棠梨苏小家。\n山径翠舆湖上出，楼船画鼓月中挝。\n如今纵有金如土，坐听荒城咽暮笳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13072,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次铁厓先生和阿春氏春愁诗韵","author":"袁宗","text":"日高斗帐朝慵卧，胡蝶双飞绣帘过。\n庭空花片蜂蜜成，槛落香泥燕巢破。\n素罗便面题两行，烧药幧头篸一个。\n清明过却不成妆，梅子枝头豆来大。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13073,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清明日偶成","author":"袁宗","text":"窗下修书寄远人，燕泥时复涴衣巾。\n东风催下清明雨，莺老花残又一春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13074,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春晓口占","author":"袁宗","text":"东风剪剪柳毵毵，欲试罗衣尚未堪。\n怪我春来愁不醒，杏花微雨似江南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13075,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江南弄二解 其一","author":"袁宗","text":"妾家横塘东，与郎乍相逢。\n郎来不须问，门外植梧桐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13076,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江南弄二解 其二","author":"袁宗","text":"妾家横塘西，春花压枝低。\n绿波净如镜，只着鸳鸯栖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13077,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄邵德昂","author":"沈应","text":"高隐青门不识尘，碧桃花下白纶巾。\n诗传画意王摩诘，船载书声米舍人。\n半板水扉兼竹净，一间草阁与山邻。\n闲情不及鸥先往，几度相思入梦频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13078,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江中晓行","author":"沈应","text":"江店鸡鸣促去桡，月斜滩口又平潮。\n楚天不尽吴天远，烟树和愁望转遥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13079,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次钱文伯题云林诗韵","author":"沈应","text":"红叶桥边草舍低，半滩斜照水平溪。\n旧时曾记求诗过，疏雨桐花幽鸟啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13080,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"楚江秋晓图","author":"沈应","text":"曾记蒹葭水庙东，客心争渡晓鸡中。\n平芜落月三湘路，千里孤舟一雁风。\n别去乡关犹在梦，老来江海尚飘蓬。\n何因得似闲鸥鸟，两两沙边睡正浓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13081,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送乐仲礼之秦邮","author":"沈应","text":"江店西风酒味香，匆匆何事促行装。\n百年一半常为客，两鬓无多易着霜。\n远水平芜秋艇去，断云归鸟暮天长。\n如今楚地皆吴语，不必逢人叹异乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13082,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将归山中留别李二公勉","author":"沈应","text":"三月风光尚夹衣，暖云笼日午行迟。\n杏园却近桃花坞，寒食相兼上巳时。\n芳草家家迷蛱蝶，棠梨树树转黄鹂。\n几回欲共行春乐，南浦归舟已有期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13083,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜墨生吴与言至","author":"沈应","text":"衣上残云屐上霜，远烦来扣竹边房。\n茶炉香满晴窗下，闲说前人制墨方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13084,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春夜二首 其一","author":"沈应","text":"彩笺吟遍惜春诗，花隐纱窗见月迟。\n欲问海棠持画烛，自嗟不是少年时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13085,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春夜二首 其二","author":"沈应","text":"半轮月映杏梢头，小院朱帘却上钩。\n莺怯轻寒犹未睡，画阑西畔替人愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13086,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和沈诚庄绎韵四首 其一","author":"邹奕","text":"春来倦行乐，春去却寻幽。\n花落随风舞，溪喧带雨流。\n乾坤真逆旅，身世似悬疣。\n何物令人羡，忘机海上鸥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13087,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和沈诚庄绎韵四首 其二","author":"邹奕","text":"闲居忘俗累，行乐喜芳春。\n露滴乌巾垫，花迎白苎新。\n清歌移晚兴，佳句涤襟尘。\n处处香醪熟，谁家味最醇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13088,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和沈诚庄绎韵四首 其三","author":"邹奕","text":"荏苒伤春老，蹉跎惜岁华。\n客居移未定，社酒不须赊。\n花柳知无恙，云山画莫加。\n寻芳徒步好，何用早将车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13089,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和沈诚庄绎韵四首 其四","author":"邹奕","text":"长须携尺素，邀客扣涂茨。\n筋力非前日，襟怀似昔时。\n酒从花下酌，船傍柳边维。\n风景还堪赏，闲游也未迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13090,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青楼曲","author":"吴文泰","text":"青楼少妇悬明榼，软金刺绣罗衣裳。\n纤歌宛转声绕梁，围屏狎坐飞琼觞。\n流苏锦帐双鸳鸯，梦魂醉入温柔乡。\n东风破暖吹红香，落花点点更漏长。\n游丝飞絮春茫茫，柔肠一寸生秋霜。\n吴山青青江水绿，燕语莺啼空断肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13091,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"横塘采莲词","author":"吴文泰","text":"采莲度横塘，荷花远近香。\n花间擘莲子，多半是空房。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13092,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人从军之永州","author":"吴文泰","text":"嗟君此别向南州，驿路迢迢万里秋。\n愁断猿声非故国，梦回月色在孤舟。\n湘潭水落鱼龙远，衡岳云开雾雨收。\n闻说从军还有乐，不须怀土更登楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13093,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"箫杖","author":"丁敏","text":"嶰谷新裁六尺形，半含宫徵半扶行。\n吹时只恐成龙去，策处常疑作凤鸣。\n挂壁影怜秦女瘦，敲门音合舜《韶》清。\n月明拄向仙坛上，同和钧天奏九成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13094,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金山寺","author":"赵文","text":"水天楼阁影重重，化国何年此寄踪。\n淮海西来三百里，大江中涌一孤峰。\n涛声夜恐巢枝鸟，云气朝随出洞龙。\n几度欲登帆去疾，苍茫遥听隔烟钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13095,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"梁时","text":"炊烟生处是柴关，只隔前溪半里山。\n偶展《汉书》随意读，不教牛角挂空还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13096,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秀野轩诗","author":"梁时","text":"素秉丘壑姿，劳生滞予往。\n览兹惬幽情，遽尔成真赏。\n林霏蔼孤墅，春物组膏壤。\n稍行樵径远，忽展耕畴广。\n所以山水情，遂结云霞想。\n挂冠苟有期，终焉税尘鞅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13097,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔父辞","author":"陈继","text":"江柳阴，江水深，钓船不到江之心。\n江心风高浪相激，纵使鱼多不易得。\n钓丝只在江边垂，得鱼无鱼心自怡。\n有时投竿把书读，残阳渐红江转绿。\n有时沽酒醉风前，沙鸥忘机相对眠。\n人生富贵那足羡，好似春鸿与秋燕。\n江柳阴，江水深，钓船不到江之心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13098,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋晚过西庵","author":"陈继","text":"游吟何处最宜频，谷木溪西第一邻。\n竹径清风啼黠鸟，柴门落日对闲人。\n穿云渐觉香裘重，照水惟怜白发新。\n常得杖藜随去住，不须琴酌在芳春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13099,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"陈继","text":"野性耽迂百念轻，幽栖随处得怡情。\n山依南郭家林好，水入西庄客舍清。\n暖日野花常护鹿，春风汀柳不辞莺。\n年来梦里添游乐，也逐渔樵结伴行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13100,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得山路送友人","author":"陈继","text":"杳杳盘云似不通，雨苔分绿断行踪。\n只应送客联游骑，踏破残花几处红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13101,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得江天暮雪送友人之官","author":"陈继","text":"漠漠江天黯黯云，晚风吹雪正纷纷。\n笼寒已禁猿争语，傍夕空教雁失群。\n影带楚兰看不见，声连湘竹听还闻。\n太平未必堪成瑞，一向谁怜好似君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13102,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"远归图","author":"陈继","text":"杜宇一声春尽，杨花千里人归。\n半卷东风罗幕，任教双燕飞飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13103,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"陈继","text":"鸟散江村社鼓，花摇酒市风帘。\n曾记踏青归去，香罗着雨廉纤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13104,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成三首 其一","author":"陈继","text":"紫陌轮蹄蹴暖尘，野猿啼处尽游人。\n相逢共道看花去，径草谁怜也得春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13105,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成三首 其二","author":"陈继","text":"岚翠霏霏湿涧萝，青山应喜我来过。\n莫教杜宇催春去，花落东风已自多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13106,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成三首 其三","author":"陈继","text":"蘋浦凉风袅鬓丝，钓鱼兼得赋新诗。\n舟移不向江桥泊，意在西岩日莫时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13107,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春江渔父","author":"陈继","text":"鬓丝如雪映沙鸥，烟渚风汀醉泊舟。\n好谢岸傍花共柳，莫将春色忌清秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13108,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过玄妙观","author":"陈继","text":"影摇红烛散庭辉，小殿香清午漏迟。\n啼鸟数声风习习，碧桐阴下立多时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13109,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]